No reliable information found from public sources.

## Visiting Practical Info
The address for Dalrymple Vineyards is 1337 Pipers Brook Road, Pipers Brook, TAS 7254, Australia.
The phone number is (03) 6382 7229.
The website is www.dalrymplevineyards.com.au.
Dalrymple Vineyards is approximately a 40-minute drive (46 kilometers) from Launceston. They have a presence on Facebook and Instagram.

## Notable / Distinctive
Dalrymple Vineyards is noted for its dedication to crafting single-site wines that reflect the unique terroir of Tasmania. The winery was founded by "Pinotphiles" who traveled to France for inspiration, planting French clones of Pinot Noir. Winemaker Peter Caldwell emphasizes allowing the environment to express itself in the wine, stating that Pinot Noir is a "complete reflection of its environment". The winery's focus on small-batch production and intimate, by-appointment tastings in a working winery lab offers a distinctive experience. They also offer a self-guided vineyard tour with audio posts for visitors to learn about the vineyard and region.

